<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Custodes genetic matrix -->
  <BEWH_GeneseedMatrixCustodes.label>禁军基因矩阵</BEWH_GeneseedMatrixCustodes.label>
  <!-- EN: Genetic matrix is a bio-mechanical construct that encodes key genetic modifications, providing the necessary instructions for stable mutations and enhancements. It is used in a Gene-seed Gestator as a template for creation of the Ascendance Vials.\n\nThis genetic matrix contains the template for making Custodes.\n\nRapidly deteriorates outside containment. -->
  <BEWH_GeneseedMatrixCustodes.description>基因矩阵是一种生物机械构造体，它对关键的基因改造进行了编码，为稳定的升华与强化提供必要指令。它在基因种子培育器中被用作制造升华原液的模板。\n\n该基因矩阵用于制造禁军。\n\n在容器外会迅速老化。</BEWH_GeneseedMatrixCustodes.description>
  
